---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout title="Quashing of Charge Sheet | Rajendra Criminal Law Firm" description="General information on quashing petitions against charge sheets.">
  <article class="max-w-3xl mx-auto px-6 py-16">
    <p class="text-gold text-sm uppercase tracking-widest mb-3">Blog</p>
    <h1 class="font-serif text-3xl md:text-4xl text-navy mb-6">Quashing of Charge Sheet</h1>
    <div class="prose prose-lg text-ink/90 leading-relaxed space-y-4">
      <p>A charge sheet may be challenged before the High Court under Section 528 of the Bharatiya Nagarik Suraksha Sanhita in appropriate cases. This is general information only.</p>
      <p>Grounds may include absence of the essential ingredients of the offence or abuse of the process of law.</p>
      <p>Each petition is fact-specific. Professional advice is necessary.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="mt-12 pt-8 border-t border-navy/10">
      <h2 class="font-serif text-xl text-navy mb-4">Related</h2>
      <ul class="space-y-2 text-sm">
        <li><a href="/practice" class="text-navy hover:text-crimson">Practice Areas</a></li>
        <li><a href="/contact" class="text-navy hover:text-crimson">Contact the Firm</a></li>
      </ul>
    </div>
  </article>
</Layout>
